    "text": "Oh, hello there! Yes, thank you for picking up. My name is Eleanor Whitfield. \n\nBut I have to say, before we dive into all that paperwork, you won't believe the week I've had with my garden. The tomatoes have just been spectacular this year -- I planted them a bit later than usual, figured with the heat we've been getting they'd do better. And they have! Though I've got to tell you, the rabbits have discovered them too, so I'm out there practically every morning shooing them away. Gets me moving, anyway, which is good for the joints.\n\nSo yes, Eleanor Whitfield. W-H-I-T-F-I-E-L-D."
