    "text": "Well, that's strange. I've been taking that celecoxib for quite a while now -- must be at least a couple years, maybe longer. Let me think... oh, it was right around the time my cat Gravy had that urinary tract infection, so that would've been... gosh, maybe two thousand twenty-two or twenty-three? Anyway, the point is, I know I'm on it because I take it every single day. Could it be under a different name, maybe? Or perhaps my doctor needs to send in a new prescription? Who's my provider there, by the way? I want to make sure we're looking at the right account. My friend mentioned she sees Doctor Zebigniew there -- is that who I see, or am I mixed up?"
